@startuml
title Heima v3 - Runtime and Authority
top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #3C4043
skinparam componentBorderColor #3C4043
skinparam packageBorderColor #80868B

component "Home Assistant\nraw entity and calendar state" as HA #FFFFFF

package "Foundation slice" {
  component "Layer 0\nTiming, Persistence, provenance,\nmanual holds, recovery, runtime health" as L0 #E6F4EA
  component "Layer 1\nHouseFact, Provenance, Location,\nZone, Topology" as L1 #E6F4EA
}

component "Layer 2\nSensor and Interpretation, FusionRule,\nformula registry, Actuator inventory" as L2 #E6F4EA
component "Layer 4 - future\nDomain DAG and current-state resolution" as L4 #FCE8E6
component "Layer 5\nPolicy evaluation, admissibility,\nordered ApplyStep generation" as L5 #E6F4EA

HA --> L2 : raw values through ReadBinding
L2 --> L0 : accepted Layer-1 HouseFact
L2 --> L4 : current typed facts
L2 --> L5 : logical Actuator inventory
L4 --> L5 : completed immutable DecisionSnapshot
L5 --> HA : one endpoint per ApplyStep

L0 -[#1A73E8,dashed]-> L1 : immutable foundation contracts only
L1 -[#1A73E8,dashed]-> L2 : HouseFact, Location, Provenance contracts

note bottom of L1
  Layer 1 is not a runtime hop.
  Layer 2 constructs a Layer-1-shaped
  HouseFact and submits it to Layer 0.
end note

note bottom of L5
  Layer 5 is downstream of the Layer-4 DAG.
  It never rereads HA or a mutable later cycle.
end note

legend right
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  |<#E6F4EA> | Defined layer |
  |<#FCE8E6> | Future layer with fixed interface |
  | Solid arrow | Operational runtime hand-off |
  | <color:#1A73E8>Blue dashed arrow</color> | Immutable contract dependency |
endlegend
@enduml
